      "value": "I've previously submitted this as a bug report: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/filling-out-bingo-card-prints-became-more-difficult-in-desktop-mode-in-build-191\n\nIt is working as intended in Build `1902`, while Build `1921` had an undocumented change. I believe it's not intended.",
