      "value": "@{617049a9b4498666e9e3b6c0|full_name}\n\n> Since the new Desktop HUD was introduced, holding Tab to interact with the HUD can also select players, portals, props, and prints if the cursor happens to be over them.\n\nThis statement is slightly incorrect factually. Build `1885` introduced the new UI to live, and build `1902` with the new UI does not experience the issue you're describing. Aside, build `1867` with the old UI also didn't experience this issue.\n\nYou can verify this by downloading Build `1902` (with the new UI), launching and testing it:\n\n1. Navigate to `steam://nav/console`.\n\n2. Download manifest 2437873671786200032 with `download_depot 438100 438101 2437873671786200032`.\n\n3. Launch VRChat from `launch.exe` from the depot download directory (`\\Steam\\steamapps\\content\\app_438100\\depot_438101\\launch.exe`).\n\n4. Print something and hold the Tab key to see it's working the way you want it to be, in Build `1902`.\n\nCompare results to the current build `1921` in live, where Tab opens the context menu of prints and such.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
